{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011MQRtC5jk9BycyHLJNSsy7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n \"id\": \"T-005\",\n \"title\": \"路径统一与配置健壮性：resolvePaths、state_dir、.gitignore（含 .collab/）、示例识别、null 配置（A4）\",\n \"inputs\": [\n  \"lib/config.mjs\",\n  \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"lib/commands/usage/**\",\n  \".gitignore\",\n  \"config/cliworker.example.json\",\n  \"第 2 节勘误第 1、2、4 条\"\n ],\n \"outputs\": [\n  \"lib/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/config.mjs（所有错误补 E_CONFIG，_example 与深相等识别）\",\n  \"lib/commands/paths.mjs、init.mjs\",\n  \".gitignore 通配规则\",\n  \"example 带 _example、schema 与 credits_per_mtok\",\n  \"defects/a4-paths 与 a4-null-config 的 [fixed] 部分\"\n ],\n \"depends_on\": [\n  \"T-002\",\n  \"T-003\",\n  \"T-004\"\n ],\n \"write_scope\": [\n  \"lib/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/config.mjs\",\n  \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"lib/commands/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/commands/init.mjs\",\n  \"lib/commands/usage/**\",\n  \".gitignore\",\n  \"config/cliworker.example.json\",\n  \"test/unit/paths.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/unit/config.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/unit/gitignore.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/integration/paths-entries.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/characterization/defects/a4-paths.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/characterization/defects/a4-null-config.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/traceability/T-005.json\"\n ],\n \"acceptance\": [\n  \"AC-012\",\n  \"AC-013\",\n  \"AC-014\"\n ],\n \"acceptance_direction\": [\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-012\",\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-013\",\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-014\",\n  \"node bin/cliworker.mjs paths --config config/cliworker.example.json\"\n ],\n \"test_levels\": [\n  \"integration\",\n  \"unit\"\n ],\n \"milestone\": \"M1\"\n}\nAC-012\",\"text\":\"resolvePaths 规则按 interfaces 第 11 节。cliworker paths --config X 与 createPlugin 使用 configPath X 时，报告完全相同的 config 绝对路径和 state_dir；两份不同的配置得到不相交的 state_dir；usage 写到该 state_dir；存在旧的 ~/.cliworker/usage.jsonl 时，doctor 给出 W_LEGACY_USAGE。defects/a4-paths 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",\"levels\":[\"integration\",\"unit\"]\nAC-013\",\"text\":\"git check-ignore -v 命中 config/a.local.json、state/x、a.jsonl、.collab/x，不命中 config/cliworker.example.json。加载带 _example:true 的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE、退出码 3；加载重新缩进过的 example 副本（无该标记）同样返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。init 遇到已存在的目标文件时返回 E_CONFIG_EXISTS，且文件不变。\",\"levels\":[\"unit\"]\nAC-014\",\"text\":\"配置根为 null、[]、42、非 JSON，或缺 providers、缺 models 时，CLI 输出 ok:false、error.code 为 E_CONFIG、退出码 3，message 含配置文件绝对路径和原因；stderr 中没有 TypeError。defects/a4-null-config 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",\"levels\":[\"unit\"]\n16:| AC-012 | integration,unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |\n17:| AC-013 | unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |\n18:| AC-014 | unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2fddf98a-d412-4780-bccc-7bad54a0b001","uuid":"c1755609-7836-45cf-8875-7be9f1fe637e","timestamp":"2026-11-07T18:23:50.995Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n \"id\": \"T-005\",\n \"title\": \"路径统一与配置健壮性：resolvePaths、state_dir、.gitignore（含 .collab/）、示例识别、null 配置（A4）\",\n \"inputs\": [\n  \"lib/config.mjs\",\n  \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"lib/commands/usage/**\",\n  \".gitignore\",\n  \"config/cliworker.example.json\",\n  \"第 2 节勘误第 1、2、4 条\"\n ],\n \"outputs\": [\n  \"lib/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/config.mjs（所有错误补 E_CONFIG，_example 与深相等识别）\",\n  \"lib/commands/paths.mjs、init.mjs\",\n  \".gitignore 通配规则\",\n  \"example 带 _example、schema 与 credits_per_mtok\",\n  \"defects/a4-paths 与 a4-null-config 的 [fixed] 部分\"\n ],\n \"depends_on\": [\n  \"T-002\",\n  \"T-003\",\n  \"T-004\"\n ],\n \"write_scope\": [\n  \"lib/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/config.mjs\",\n  \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"lib/commands/paths.mjs\",\n  \"lib/commands/init.mjs\",\n  \"lib/commands/usage/**\",\n  \".gitignore\",\n  \"config/cliworker.example.json\",\n  \"test/unit/paths.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/unit/config.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/unit/gitignore.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/integration/paths-entries.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/characterization/defects/a4-paths.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/characterization/defects/a4-null-config.test.mjs\",\n  \"test/traceability/T-005.json\"\n ],\n \"acceptance\": [\n  \"AC-012\",\n  \"AC-013\",\n  \"AC-014\"\n ],\n \"acceptance_direction\": [\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-012\",\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-013\",\n  \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-014\",\n  \"node bin/cliworker.mjs paths --config config/cliworker.example.json\"\n ],\n \"test_levels\": [\n  \"integration\",\n  \"unit\"\n ],\n \"milestone\": \"M1\"\n}\nAC-012\",\"text\":\"resolvePaths 规则按 interfaces 第 11 节。cliworker paths --config X 与 createPlugin 使用 configPath X 时，报告完全相同的 config 绝对路径和 state_dir；两份不同的配置得到不相交的 state_dir；usage 写到该 state_dir；存在旧的 ~/.cliworker/usage.jsonl 时，doctor 给出 W_LEGACY_USAGE。defects/a4-paths 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",\"levels\":[\"integration\",\"unit\"]\nAC-013\",\"text\":\"git check-ignore -v 命中 config/a.local.json、state/x、a.jsonl、.collab/x，不命中 config/cliworker.example.json。加载带 _example:true 的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE、退出码 3；加载重新缩进过的 example 副本（无该标记）同样返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。init 遇到已存在的目标文件时返回 E_CONFIG_EXISTS，且文件不变。\",\"levels\":[\"unit\"]\nAC-014\",\"text\":\"配置根为 null、[]、42、非 JSON，或缺 providers、缺 models 时，CLI 输出 ok:false、error.code 为 E_CONFIG、退出码 3，message 含配置文件绝对路径和原因；stderr 中没有 TypeError。defects/a4-null-config 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",\"levels\":[\"unit\"]\n16:| AC-012 | integration,unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |\n17:| AC-013 | unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |\n18:| AC-014 | unit | T-005 | T-005:integration,unit |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011MQRtC5jk9BycyHLJNSsy7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
